#. module: sale_import_delivery
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_import_delivery.field_delivery_carrier__sale_import_charge_freight
msgid "The seller delivers the imported orders of this carrier and charges the customer for it: the shipping amount sent by the channel is added to the order. Uncheck it when the sale channel delivers and keeps the shipping amount."
msgstr "O vendedor entrega os pedidos importados desta transportadora e cobra o frete do cliente: o valor do frete enviado pelo canal entra no pedido. Desmarque quando o canal de venda faz a entrega e fica com o valor do frete."